        {
         "_key": "00bbdd564a6c",
         "_type": "span",
         "text": ", change the heading to STATEMENT, and enter the opening balance, then each invoice, payment and credit as a dated line. Enter payments and credits as negative amounts, so the total at the bottom, already labelled AMOUNT DUE, is the balance owed. The template shows one total rather than a running balance column, so keep the running balance in your own records and check the two agree.",
